OL,3,APM says bailed sex offender case must
OL,4,Abe reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said that the
OL,7,Fdecision to bail a sex offender and
OL,8,Frepeatedly allow him to return to his
OL,9,Fhome overlooking the playground he
OL,10,Ftargeted must be reviewed.
OL,12,FZafer Dogan, 32, of Enfield, north
OL,13,FLondon, was jailed on Thursday for two
OL,14,Fyears and four months for taking
OL,15,Fthousands of pictures of children and
OL,16,Fusing AI software to "nudify" them.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
