OL,3,APM says bailed sex offender case must
OL,4,Abe reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham called the case
OL,7,F"disturbing", adding: "I would ask
OL,8,Fthose working across the criminal
OL,9,Fjustice system to look at it and to
OL,10,Fmake any necessary changes as a
OL,11,Fresult."
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice said while the
OL,14,FCrown Prosecution Service had the right
OL,15,Fto challenge them, final bail decisions
OL,16,Fwere "made by the independent
OL,17,Fjudiciary".
